Package: raptor-studio
Version: __VERSION__
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OpenPowerShift <info@openpowershift.com>
Depends: libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1,
 libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1,
 libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xinerama0,
 libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0
Recommends: libnss3
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_KB__
Description: Reliability block diagram simulation (open Python port of Raptor 7)
 RAPTOR Studio draws reliability block diagrams, runs Monte Carlo
 reliability simulations and reports reliability, availability and
 cost numbers. Includes an in-app tutorial book, a field-by-field
 reference manual (F1) and a stepping debugger.
Homepage: https://github.com/openpowershift/RaptorStudio
